  "review": "<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【2026】香川県といえばコレ！本場讃岐うどん巡り・オリーブ牛・骨付鳥・銘酒「金陵」＆こんぴら温泉名宿比較</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-6 p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 via-emerald-50/40 to-stone-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-3xl shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-amber-950 flex items-center gap-2\">🍜 いりこ出汁香る本場「讃岐うどん」とオリーブ牛！金刀比羅宮の石段参拝とこんぴら温泉</h3>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">日本一小さな県に魅力が凝縮した香川県。785段の石段を登る「金刀比羅宮」、瀬戸内海のオリーブの島「小豆島」。朝から楽しむ「讃岐うどん巡り」、ジューシーな「骨付鳥」、小豆島産オリーブで育った極上「オリーブ牛」。金刀比羅宮の御神酒「金陵」「川鶴」。こんぴら温泉の露天風呂で心洗われる旅を満喫できます。</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-2 my-6 flex items-center gap-2\">🏆 香川県を代表する最高峰名宿</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第1位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">ことひら温泉　琴参閣</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.37</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/14833/14833.jpg\" alt=\"ことひら温泉　琴参閣 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 金刀比羅宮参道すぐ！ことひら温泉屈指の広さを誇る大浴場と讃岐味覚会席</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">こんぴらさん参拝の拠点。多彩な温泉大浴場や露天風呂、オリーブ牛ステーキや讃岐うどん、瀬戸内鮮魚会席がファミリーやグループに大人気。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>ファミリー、三世代、金刀比羅宮参拝派</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>こんぴらさん参道すぐの好立地と広大な温泉大浴場なら迷わずここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D14833\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】ことひら温泉　琴参閣 の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第2位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">湯元こんぴら温泉華の湯　紅梅亭</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.62</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/5901/5901.jpg\" alt=\"湯元こんぴら温泉華の湯　紅梅亭 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 数寄屋造りの風雅と露天風呂付き客室！オリーブ牛と瀬戸内海の旬会席</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">こんぴら温泉のハイクラス名旅館。四季の日本庭園、バラ風呂や多彩な湯巡り、専属シェフが焼き上げるオリーブ牛ステーキが最高峰の評価。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid gr